  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy for OKUP Organisation Assessment and Development Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD and Secours Catholique Caritas France (SCCF) are jointly funding a consultancy that will take place between March and October 2025 in order to support OKUP&apos;s organisational development.   In conjunction with OKUP&apos;s senior staff, the Consultant will carry out a full organisational assessment, covering all facets of the organisation including structure, governance, the board, constitutional &amp; strategic documents, human resources, funding, policies and procedures, safeguarding, risk assessments and data management.  The report will be finalised following a validation workshop.  Once the assessment has been finalised, the Consultant will work with OKUP senior management to draw up a costed Organisational Plan that will be finalised following a second validation workshop.  The budget allows for two visits to Bangladesh by the Consultant.</narrative>
  </description>
